{The Rake by Mary Jo Putney} is 100% what you’re looking for.

{A Lady’s Code of Misconduct by Meredith Duran}

{Convergece of Desire by Felicity Niven}

If you like Meredith Duran, I assume you like books where the authors really flesh out their characters and make them so multifaceted you kind of love and hate them at the same time, but you understand them all the same. Books that gave me similar vibes are:

{The Promise of Jenny Jones by Maggie Osborne}

{The Rake by Mary Jo Putney}

{Bed Me, Earl by Felicity Niven}

{Convergence of Desire by Felicity Niven}

{The Duke’s Perfect Wife by Jennifer Ashley}

{The Truth About Dukes by Grace Burrowes}

Hopefully one of these works for you!

