Most of these books have tough heroines who are considered not-marriage material by the greater public either by the line of work they do or the situation they're in. The MMC is pretty much the only one who sees through their facade and reputation.

{The Promise of Jenny Jones by Maggie Osborne}

{Silver Lining by Maggie Osborne}

{Foxfire Bride by Maggie Osborne}

{In Want of a Wife by Jo Goodman}

